	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p12_badman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にやにや！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T02:37:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>にやにや！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T02:37:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX=18、GRIDZ=30、下向き固定
